# Telos, Czerka's files (TSL, 202TEL, 207TEL, 203TEL, 209TEL, 204TEL):
# Chodo's Mission 3: Corrun Falt in the cantina, who points at B-4D4; Opo
# Chano's droid credentials in 082 East's B2 (his Exchange debt paid);
# B-4D4 reprogrammed at the Ithorians and played as him in the Czerka
# offices (Lorso lied to, the astromech lied to, the mainframe copied and
# our record erased); back to Chodo. Starts from the Exchange route's
# checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_czerka_files data/routes/tsl/telos_czerka_files.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Working for the Ithorians", Mission #3
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
say Transit to another module # the terminal's transit to 081 and the cantina
say Entertainment Module 081
use info_term
talk
module 202tel
say Just let me shop. # the Dobo brothers' shop: Dendis buys what we carry,
use Dendis           # enough for Corrun Falt's price (our Persuade fails
sell 1200            # him, DSimpson pays the thousand)
exit d_Cantina@3
module 207tel
say Tell me about Lorso   # Corrun Falt by the dancers' platform: dirt on
say Maybe I can help you  # Lorso, the mainframe; B-4D4 the way in, Opo
say There are some files  # Chano's credentials the way to him
say Something like that
say So how do I get in?
say [Persuade] Of course not
say Here you go, 1,000 credits
say But how would I get access to B-4D4
say All right. I'll be going now
use 207_Falt
talk
save telos_falt
exit d_Cantina_main  # to 082 East's B block: Opo Chano, who needs his
module 202tel        # Czerka contract to pay an Exchange loan
exit d_Suburban
module 203tel
say Your droid technician credentials
say I need to borrow Czerka's administrative droid
say Because I need him
say You can't? Why not?
say Your contract?
say Credits? What for?
say A loan? From whom?
say Hey, I answered
say I could give you an extension
say I'll be back when I have the credits
use ComplexB
use Apartment@1
use 203_Chano
talk
save telos_chano
say Transit to another module # to the Ithorian compound: Chodo lends the
say Residential Module 082 West # 2500 credits for Chano's loan
use info_term
talk
module 204tel
say I need 2,500 credits to pay off
use 204_Habat
talk
say Transit to another module # back to Chano: his loan paid, the credits
say Residential Module 082 East # not to be repaid (LSP), the credentials
use info_term        # ours
talk
module 203tel
say Yes, here: 2500 credits
say Keep the money in return for the credentials
use Apartment@1
use 203_Chano
talk
save telos_credentials
exit Czerka          # B-4D4 at the Czerka offices' desk: he comes with us
module 209tel        # on the credentials, to be reprogrammed by Chodo's
say I need you to come with me # technicians
say I have my droid technician credentials right here
say Let's go now
use 203_b4d4
talk
module 204tel
talk                 # Chodo: B-4D4 reprogrammed; we play him now
say I understand     # Chodo's briefing: the files, and a lie allowed
use 204_Habat
talk
save telos_b4d4
exit to_203TEL       # B-4D4 back to the Czerka offices: Lorso lied to
module 203tel        # (income discrepancies to check in the mainframe)
exit Czerka
module 209tel
say There are some files that I must access in the mainframe
say [Lie] There are some discrepancies
say Thank you, Mistress Lorso
use 203_Lorso
talk
to 203_t1n1          # the mainframe room: T1-N1 talked round (no choices
talk                 # past the first), and out on its rampage
say Copy the necessary files # the mainframe: the files copied, our record
say Erase all data   # erased
say =Yes.
say =Log out.
use 203_mainframe
talk
save telos_files
exit Czerka          # the files to Chodo, by the terminal's transit
module 203tel
say Transit to another module
say Residential Module 082 West
use info_term
talk
module 204tel
say Yes. I have transferred them # the files handed over; B-4D4 lets go
say I assure you that I will cause no trouble # (no lie), and we are
use 204_Habat        # ourselves again
talk
say I'm glad I could help # Chodo: the files to the TSF; Bao-Dur at RZ-0031
use 204_Habat        # can find the Ebon Hawk, an Ithorian shuttle in Bay
talk                 # Two to reach him; and his healing (+Force)
save telos_rescue
